5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I wonder if we should look at the staff survey first. It feels important to hear what everyone actually wants before moving anything.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"The survey shows preference, not consequence. We need to know who absorbs the noise and glare before we decide where desks go.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I’m a bit worried about the budget. Maybe we should check the floor billing basis first?,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mio,,I’m worried about losing my short gaps between meetings! Let’s check the morning routine upstairs to see how much time the changeover actually eats.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,Comfort is the only metric that actually matters for eight-hour stints. I’ll check the sound meter readings and the physio’s note.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Toshio, you make a fair point about the noise. I’d like to see the sound meter readings to understand that better.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,Agreed. I’ll examine the facilities quote and the unplanned seat shuffles. We need to understand the cost and the history of our failures.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I’ll look into the floor billing basis and the facilities quote. I need to understand the actual costs before we commit.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Mio,,I’ll check the badge records and what the new joiners reported. I need to see exactly how arrival times and habits shift during the move!,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,I’m already on it. Sound and posture are non-negotiable. I’ll stick to those two.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Mio, your concern about the gaps is very valid. I hope the morning routine check helps us find a rhythm that works for everyone.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Mio, your gaps are a luxury. I’m focused on the structural flaws. We must address the root causes, not just the symptoms.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I... I agree with Toshio. The structure matters. I’m just trying to make sure we don’t overspend.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Mio,,"@Toshio, they’re not a luxury! They’re my survival. I’m checking the badge records and the new joiners’ reports to see the real daily impact.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"Toshio, calling comfort a symptom is a bold move. I’m just ensuring the furniture doesn’t destroy us.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"@Toshio, I hear your frustration, but let’s not be too harsh. I’ll look into the drawn plan and the staff survey to see if we can find a middle ground.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I am not harsh. I am precise. The survey will reveal the imbalance. I will look into the drawn plan and the staff survey.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I’ll check the floor billing basis and the facilities quote. I need to know the real costs before we decide.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Mio,,I’m locking in the badge records and the new joiners’ reports! I need to see exactly how our mornings get disrupted.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,Finalizing my choices. Sound meter readings and the physio’s note. Comfort is the only metric that actually matters for eight-hour stints.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
