60,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"I worry about the chaos of free seating. A fixed, gentle arrangement feels safer for our daily rhythm and peace.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Toshio,,Option B. Fixed desks by function. We must name the burden explicitly. No more hidden imbalances or accidental shuffles.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I think Option B is best. It avoids the 6,200 yen fee for moving desks. It’s safer for the budget.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Mio,,"@Toshio, Option B sounds rigid! But if it protects my tiny gaps, I’m in! I just need a spot that respects my schedule!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Option B. Fixed desks. My chair needs days to settle, not a daily lottery. I’m taking the window side. No arguments.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Shunichi, I hope you can be flexible. I worry that claiming the window side leaves others in the dark. Let’s find a fair balance.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Shunichi, claiming the window is a privilege, not a right. We must decide who takes the wall deliberately, not by default.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I agree with Toshio. We need to be deliberate. I just want to make sure we don’t pay extra for changes later.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Mio,,"@Shunichi, please don’t hog the window! My gaps are tiny, so I need a spot where I can work fast without interruptions.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Mio, the window isn’t a toy. It’s the only quiet zone. If you need speed, sit by the printer and shout. I need silence.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Shunichi, please be kind. We all need our own quiet corners. Let’s find a way to share the light and the peace fairly.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Shunichi, silence is a resource, not a birthright. We must allocate the wall seats explicitly. Who accepts the burden?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I think I can take the wall. It’s quieter, and it saves us the moving fee. I’m okay with it.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Mio,,"@Daisuke, you’re so sweet! But I need a spot that protects my tiny gaps. I can’t risk interruptions!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Daisuke, the wall isn’t quieter, it’s just different. I’m taking the window. My chair needs stability, not your sacrifice.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Shizue,,"@Daisuke, your kindness is a gift. I will take the wall seat to share the burden. Let us choose Option B, so we can finally settle and breathe together.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Toshio,,"I accept Daisuke’s offer. The burden is now named, not hidden. I vote for Option B.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I’m sorry. I can’t take the wall. I’m too quiet. Please, let’s just vote for Option B.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Mio,,I vote for Option B! Fixed desks mean my gaps stay safe. No more chaotic morning scrambles eating my precious time!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Shunichi,,"Option B. Fixed desks. My chair needs days to settle, not a daily lottery. I’m taking the window side. No arguments.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
